# Legacy: the compiled LevelDB packs landed at the repository root until the
# packs moved into the build stage (#26). Kept so a checkout that still carries
# the old directory does not report it as untracked.
/packs

# The website: `site/` holds the Hugo configuration, and nothing else that is
# authored. The one page comes from `assets/content/homepage.md` via
# `content-build site` (`site.out` in package-build.config.yaml), Hugo's caches
# and lock are its own, and the rendered output goes to `build/site/kethira/`,
# which `build/` above already covers.
/site/content/
/site/public/
/site/resources/
/site/.hugo_build.lock

